%% Guardian email — send-request flow (POST /api/v1/email/send-option, Brevo)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Consumer
  participant S as Express + Auth
  participant Ctl as emailController
  participant Svc as emailService
  participant T as templates
  participant P as brevoProvider
  participant B as Brevo API
  participant DB as MongoDB (inbox)

  C->>S: POST /email/send-option { to, option }
  S->>S: verifyToken + verifyRole('admin')
  S->>Ctl: sendOption(req)
  Ctl->>Svc: sendByOption(option, to, data)
  Svc->>T: fill sample + render(option)
  T-->>Svc: subject, html, text
  Svc->>Svc: validate address · allowlist · dry-run?
  Svc->>P: send(payload)  [provider = brevo]
  P->>B: sendTransacEmail(payload + API key)
  B-->>P: { messageId }
  P-->>Svc: { provider: brevo, messageId }
  Svc->>DB: persist sent record (best-effort)
  Svc-->>Ctl: { status: sent, messageId }
  Ctl-->>C: 202 Accepted
